#: includes/class-dabn-privacy.php:41
msgid "Suggested text for stores that ask for an ABN:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-dabn-privacy.php:42
msgid "If you give us an Australian Business Number (ABN) at checkout, we keep it with your order and your account so it can appear on your invoices. To confirm that it is a current ABN, we send the number to the Australian Business Register (ABN Lookup), a service of the Australian Government, and keep the business name, entity type, GST registration status, state and postcode it returns with your order. The register receives the ABN only; it does not receive your name, your address or anything about your order."
msgstr ""

